From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Subject: [PATCH] plugins: report SMS status reports on D-Bus
 (org.ofono.SmsHistory)

oFono asks for an SMS status report when UseDeliveryReports is on and
matches the report to the message it sent, but then only tells its
history drivers, and none is built. A client has no way to learn that
a message was delivered.

This is the sms_history plugin of Sailfish OS
(ofono/plugins/smshistory.c in https://github.com/sailfishos/ofono:
Martti Piirainen, 2013, 5589eb3308 and 41adfc3d49; Denis Grigorev,
2020, 56e0923dc3 for every modem), with its copyright lines kept. It registers
org.ofono.SmsHistory on each modem and sends

  StatusReport(string message, dict info)

for each report: message is the path the message had while it was
sent, <modem>/message_<uuid>, as SendMessage returned it, and info
holds "Delivered" (boolean). Submit results are left to the Message
object's State, as before.

Changed from Sailfish's version: the signal is declared with the
signature it sends (a{sv}, Sailfish declares a{b}), the path is built
with g_strconcat instead of a 160 byte buffer, the signal is sent from
the modem path where the interface is registered (the same path as
the SMS atom's), and declarations come first.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Sailfish OS API, upstream oFono has no D-Bus interface for status reports]
---
 Makefile.am          |   3 +
 plugins/smshistory.c | 171 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 174 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 plugins/smshistory.c

diff --git a/Makefile.am b/Makefile.am
index 55708a6..57bfed3 100644
--- a/Makefile.am
+++ b/Makefile.am
@@ -633,6 +633,9 @@ endif
 builtin_modules += smart_messaging
 builtin_sources += plugins/smart-messaging.c
 
+builtin_modules += sms_history
+builtin_sources += plugins/smshistory.c
+
 builtin_modules += push_notification
 builtin_sources += plugins/push-notification.c
 
diff --git a/plugins/smshistory.c b/plugins/smshistory.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b4a3571
--- /dev/null
+++ b/plugins/smshistory.c
@@ -0,0 +1,171 @@
